# The repository root is a build context only as `gitmeta`, the named context
# docker-compose.dokploy.yml hands both images: their last build step reads the commit from
# the clone's git metadata (backend/scripts/build-commit.sh). Only that metadata goes
# through; the rest of the checkout stays out of the build.
*
!.git/HEAD
!.git/refs
!.git/packed-refs
